From: openEuler RISC-V Maintainers <noreply@example.invalid>
Date: Tue, 8 Sep 2026 00:00:00 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] Keep distribution format-security checks enabled

Do not disable all format diagnostics for the embedded C core. Distribution
build flags enable -Werror=format-security, which GCC rejects when -Wformat is
disabled. Keeping format diagnostics enabled also preserves the intended
security check.

---
 CMakeLists.txt | 1 -
 1 file changed, 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/CMakeLists.txt b/CMakeLists.txt
index 88da5e4..0973421 100644
--- a/CMakeLists.txt
+++ b/CMakeLists.txt
@@ -117,3 +117,2 @@
 set(CMAKE_C_FLAGS "${CMAKE_C_FLAGS} -Wno-incompatible-pointer-types")
-set(CMAKE_C_FLAGS "${CMAKE_C_FLAGS} -Wno-format")
 set(CMAKE_C_FLAGS "${CMAKE_C_FLAGS} -Wno-sign-compare")
--
2.51.0
